<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins and butts untested; sknd. hams and sdls. bellies steady; lean trimmings not fully established.</p>
